# A lookup by name through the unknown object finds the members of the built-in objects that have reached native code, but no member whose call starts unseen code: `x.dlopen(..)` names nothing, also once process has escaped.
# It is no event, and the run time refuses the call
# RUN: flow-links unseen
# CHECK-NOT: unseen
# CHECK: unknown-javascript no

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
function f0 name="main" kind=Module results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = Builtin builtin=GlobalThis
    v1 = PropGet v0 key="sink" [isFreeName]
    v2 = Builtin builtin=Process
    v3 = Call v1, -, v2
    v4 = PropGet v0 key="input" [isFreeName]
    v5 = PropGet v4 key="dlopen"
    v6 = Call v5, v4, v4 calleeKey="dlopen"
    Return
}
